terday and my  phone blew up and i was about two miles  from home and i'm dragging the dog stop  stuffing let's go and i'm trying to call  people and running at the same time so  our days are interesting i love the job  and the supreme court keeps us busy all  right your dog got a shorter walk we'll  explain to him later  good job shannon thank you

